<title>POLAND: Polish KPW approves Drosed new share issue.</title>
<headline>Polish KPW approves Drosed new share issue.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's Securities Commission (KPW) on Thursday cleared poultry producer  Drosed Siedleckie Zaklady Drobiarskie SA (Drosed) new issue of 160,000 to 300,000 shares for public trading, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company earlier said the offering would be divided into two tranches, for large and smaller investors.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
